{{en-noun|head=[[mushroom]] [[cloud]]}}

# A large, mushroom-shaped cloud of [[smoke]], [[flame]] and [[debris]] that [[rise]]s into the [[sky]] as a result of a large [[explosion]], especially after a [[nuclear]] explosion.

